        "passed": false,
        "reason": "Uses connection strings (EVENT_HUB_CONNECTION_STRING, STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING) instead of @azure/identity with DefaultAzureCredential or a token credential. This is a significant Azure SDK best practice gap."
      },
      {
        "name": "Error Handling",
        "passed": true,
