        "passed": false,
        "reason": "No @azure/identity dependency. Code uses connection strings (EVENT_HUB_CONNECTION_STRING, STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING) for both Event Hubs and Storage. No token credential is used anywhere."
      },
      {
        "name": "Client Constructor with Endpoint and Credential",
        "passed": false,
        "reason": "EventHubProducerClient, EventHubConsumerClient, and ContainerClient are all constructed with connection strings, not endpoint URL + credential objects."
